# Check everything out with LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows runner checks out CRLF, the generated agents/*.md are written with
# LF by the build, and `git diff --exit-code` reports the whole tree as modified -- a
# build-sync check that fails for its own reasons, which is indistinguishable from one that
# found a stale build.
* text=auto eol=lf
